  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là tâm hình vuông vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là trục đường tròn ngoại tiếp <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Lại vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là tâm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Từ đó suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là điểm cách đều các điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>I</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/c224e77d8d4c25e453e03d31908376be2f2c034bfb9dedb94ee57e4e5e4aafc8.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
